'''Aurora''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2021 Christmas Box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2021|2021 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade and handle are solid black with a few stars present, resembling the night sky. The edge of the blade and the guard take the design of a green and pink aurora, hence the name.

==Trivia==
* It has a [[Aurora Gun (2021)|partner gun]] under the same name.

